{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113175","id":3045790712,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc61ixP4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113175","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113175.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113175.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113175","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113175/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113175/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113175/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/df2d7d89d172bd91bf39c1d5c291770b44155389","number":113175,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add Apple Vision Pro hand tracking support - Core bridge layer","user":{"login":"doInfinitely","id":5546667,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDY2Njc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5546667?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely","html_url":"https://github.com/doInfinitely","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/doInfinitely/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\nThis PR implements the core hand tracking bridge for Apple Vision Pro integration in Godot Engine. It provides the foundation for exposing ARKit hand tracking data to Godot's XR system.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\nApple Vision Pro is a major new XR platform that Godot should support. This PR lays the groundwork for hand tracking support by:\r\n- Creating a C bridge layer for Swift/ARKit integration\r\n- Implementing HandTrackingServer singleton\r\n- Integrating with Godot's existing XRHandTracker system\r\n\r\n## Implementation Details\r\n\r\n### Core Components\r\n1. **C Bridge Layer** (`hand_tracking.h`, `hand_tracking_bridge.cpp`)\r\n   - Pure C API callable from Swift/visionOS\r\n   - Thread-safe frame storage\r\n   - Supports 32 joints per hand with position/orientation data\r\n\r\n2. **HandTrackingServer Singleton** (`hand_tracking_server.cpp`)\r\n   - Manages XRHandTracker instances for both hands\r\n   - Maps ARKit joint IDs to Godot's joint enumeration\r\n   - Registers with XRServer for XR integration\r\n\r\n3. **Module Structure**\r\n   - Follows Godot module conventions\r\n   - Cross-platform compatible\r\n   - Proper initialization/cleanup lifecycle\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n- ✅ Thread-safe hand tracking data storage\r\n- ✅ Integration with existing XR system (XRServer/XRHandTracker)\r\n- ✅ Support for 20 hand joints per hand (ARKit standard)\r\n- ✅ GDScript API via HandTrackingServer singleton\r\n- ✅ Demo scene showing basic usage\r\n- ✅ Swift integration example for platform layer\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- Module compiles cleanly on macOS\r\n- Integrates with existing XR infrastructure\r\n- Demo code demonstrates proper usage patterns\r\n\r\n## Future Work (PR #2)\r\nThe next PR will add:\r\n- Higher-level HandTracker3D node\r\n- Gesture recognition helpers\r\n- Enhanced visualization tools\r\n- XRHandModifier3D integration\r\n- Comprehensive documentation\r\n\r\n## Files Changed\r\n```\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/config.py                           (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/SCsub                               (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/hand_tracking.h                     (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/hand_tracking_bridge.h              (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/hand_tracking_bridge.cpp            (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/hand_tracking_server.h              (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/hand_tracking_server.cpp            (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/register_types.h                    (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/register_types.cpp                  (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/README.md                           (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/IMPLEMENTATION.md                   (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/demo/hand_tracking_demo.gd          (new)\r\nmodules/hand_tracking/demo/HandTrackingIntegration.swift  (new)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Breaking Changes\r\nNone - this is a new module with no impact on existing code.\r\n\r\n## Documentation\r\n- [x] Module README with architecture overview\r\n- [x] GDScript usage example\r\n- [x] Swift integration example\r\n- [x] Implementation details document\r\n- [ ] API documentation (will add in PR #2 with doc_classes/)\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n- [x] Code follows Godot style guide\r\n- [x] Module structure follows conventions\r\n- [x] Thread-safe implementation\r\n- [x] No breaking changes\r\n- [x] Demo code provided\r\n- [ ] Tested on actual Vision Pro hardware (requires platform integration)","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-26T02:52:19Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T21:23:43Z","closed_at":"2025-11-26T10:54:55Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"be466956feae7f0124e836f02059bfe902a6ea0c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"doInfinitely:feature/vis